    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "• Two bedroom, ground floor, own-door apartment `C1` rated, extending to approx. 72.86 sq.m/784 sq.ft\n• Accommodation comprises reception porch, living room, kitchen/dining area, inner hall, two bedrooms and bathroom \n• Own- door entrance on ground floor, secure gated community with electric gates, landscaped planting and green area, one designated car space and ample visitors parking \n• Located within minutes of Naas town centre with its extensive range of amenities including schools, shops, bars, restaurants, and an abundance of sporting and recreational facilities \n• Excellent commuter access via the M7 motorway (Junction 9), regular bus services from the town, and a direct train service from Sallins/Naas station to Dublin Heuston \n\nGuide Price\n295,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\nReception Porch 0.95m x 0.99m\nOwn-door entrance with alarm panel, leading into the living room.\n\nLiving Room 4.00m x 5.39m\nSemi-solid flooring, radiator cover, coving, curtain rail, feature window overlooking the green with decorative downlights and wall lights, double door frame leading through to the kitchen.\n\nKitchen / Dining 4.80m x 4.00m\nVinyl flooring throughout, radiator cover, coving, fully fitted eye and floor level kitchen units with composite sink, electric hob, Beko oven and extractor fan, integrated dishwasher, Hoover washing machine and integrated fridge freezer, subway tile splashback and additional sockets, downlights, sliding doors leading out to the rear communal area.\nLeads to both bedrooms and the bathroom.\n\nBedroom 1 3.77m x 3.37m\nSemi-solid flooring, coving and curtain rail.\n\nBedroom 2 3.80m x 3.85m x 2.53m\nFitted wardrobes, semi-solid flooring, coving and downlights.\n\nBathroom 3.00m x 1.95m\nVinyl flooring, heated towel radiator, w.h.b. with vanity unit, shower cubicle with electric shower with monsoon shower head and additional power shower head, decorative mosaic feature tiles, integrated mirror and downlights.\n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 72.86 sq.m/784 sq.ft \nBuilt in 2000\nAll radiators replaced throughout \nGas boiler \nOne designated parking space included & visitor allocations\nMaster bedroom ceiling insulated\nOwner-occupied \nAnnual management fee of 1,750 covering bin collection and building insurance.\n\nItems Included in sale:\nElectric hob, Beko oven and extractor fan, integrated dishwasher, Hoover washing machine and integrated fridge freezer\n\nServices\nMains water\nGas fired central heating \n\nBER \nC1\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W91 N8X0\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nJill Wright \n045832020\n\n"
      },
